WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.620
I love that we have a cutout
right behind you, Andy,

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:05.350
of a woman who just doesn't seem

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:06.990
to be enjoying the show that much,

00:00:06.990 --> 00:00:08.200
to be honest with you.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.560
She's holding a pop doll and has like,

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:13.230
a caricature shirt of us.

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:14.460
[Conan] Yeah.

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:15.910
I don't know.

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:17.320
So she's clearly a big fan,

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:19.720
she just doesn't love
this episode of the show.

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:22.686
Right, or she just needs
a medication change.

00:00:22.686 --> 00:00:24.103
That's always a possibility.

00:00:24.103 --> 00:00:25.690
[Conan] Yeah okay, and
the guy next to you.

00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:26.523
Oh, this guy?

00:00:26.523 --> 00:00:28.260
[Conan] Well no, well
first of all him, yeah.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:30.250
Talk about him needing
a medication change.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:31.268
Yeah.

00:00:31.268 --> 00:00:35.513
Even this kinda, I mean, it stinks.

00:00:35.513 --> 00:00:36.490
(laughing)

00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:38.029
It smells sweaty.

00:00:38.029 --> 00:00:38.862
Even the cardboard thing stinks.

00:00:38.862 --> 00:00:41.210
[Conan] Even the cardboard
smells like sweat.

00:00:41.210 --> 00:00:42.043
Yeah.

00:00:42.043 --> 00:00:43.300
Once again, I just have to say,

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:46.670
I am thrilled that so many
of our fans sent in photos

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:48.300
allowing us to make cardboard cutouts

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:50.060
and fill our audience.

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:53.180
They really all seem like lovely people,

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:54.373
except for one.

00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:57.158
Caleb.

00:00:57.158 --> 00:00:58.840
(ominous music)

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:01.013
I just despise Caleb.

00:01:02.690 --> 00:01:04.240
I'm up here working hard,

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:07.610
trying to entertain
America during a pandemic,

00:01:07.610 --> 00:01:10.703
and everyone's happy except Caleb.

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:14.283
Thinks he's so much better than me.

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:19.853
Looking down his nose at the
performing chimp up on stage.

00:01:21.089 --> 00:01:22.033
Oh Caleb.

00:01:23.630 --> 00:01:26.900
I think I hate you more
than anyone in this crowd,

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:28.480
with the possible exception

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:31.463
of that guy.

00:01:34.350 --> 00:01:35.860
Jordan.

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:40.860
Why, why did we put a cutout
of Jordan in the crowd

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:43.450
pretending to be an illusionist?

00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:44.880
What?

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:47.500
Andy, what would possibly be the point?

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:50.090
The only upside to this quarantine

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:52.460
is that I don't see Jordan regularly.

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:54.810
We went to the trouble, somebody,

00:01:54.810 --> 00:01:56.963
to have a cardboard cutout of Jordan

00:01:56.963 --> 00:01:59.574
put in the crowd to glower at me.

00:01:59.574 --> 00:02:00.690
Yes.

00:02:00.690 --> 00:02:02.850
Well actually, it's funny

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:05.500
because the cardboard cutout
is far more productive

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:07.509
than the actual Jordan.

00:02:07.509 --> 00:02:10.470
[Conan] Yeah, the actually Jordan.

00:02:10.470 --> 00:02:11.303
Look at him!

00:02:11.303 --> 00:02:14.440
The actual Jordan does so little.

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:16.960
Yet the cardboard cutout is just

00:02:16.960 --> 00:02:18.410
kicking ass and taking names.

